(>> Solution to Question 2:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze Nested Conditionals versus Chained Comparisons and Flat Refactoring. Discuss the 'Dangling Else' problem and how Python's indentation eliminates it.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Dangling Else Problem in Classic Languages:) Tj
T*
(   In languages like C, C++, and Java that do not enforce whitespace formatting, the following) Tj
T*
(   code is ambiguous:) Tj
T*
(   if \(x > 0\)) Tj
T*
(   if \(y > 0\)) Tj
T*
(   printf\("A"\);) Tj
T*
(   else) Tj
T*
(   printf\("B"\);) Tj
T*
(   Does the 'else' bind to the outer if\(x > 0\) or inner if\(y > 0\)?) Tj
T*
(   In C/Java, grammar rules resolve this by binding the 'else' to the nearest preceding if, which) Tj
T*
(   frequently contradicts programmer indentation and introduces severe security defects.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Python's Indentation-Delimited Disambiguation:) Tj
T*
(   Python completely eradicates the dangling else problem. Because Python's parser strictly) Tj
T*
(   adheres to indentation levels, an else block is bound unequivocally to the if statement) Tj
T*
(   possessing the exact same column indentation!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Nested Conditionals vs Flat Guard Clauses:) Tj
T*
(   Deep nesting of conditionals creates 'Pyramid of Doom' antipatterns with high cyclomatic) Tj
T*
(   complexity. Software engineering best practices advocate:) Tj
T*
(   1. Chained comparisons: \(0 < x < 100\) instead of \(x > 0 and x < 100\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Early return guard clauses: Validating edge cases immediately and exiting.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Python Code Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   # Antipattern: Deeply Nested Conditionals) Tj
T*
(   def verify_user_nested\(user\):) Tj
T*
(   if user is not None:) Tj
T*
(   if user.get\("is_authenticated"\):) Tj
T*
(   if user.get\("role"\) == "admin":) Tj
T*
(   return "Admin Access Granted") Tj
T*
(   else:) Tj
T*
(   return "Unauthorized Role") Tj
T*
(   else:) Tj
T*
(   return "Unauthenticated") Tj
T*
ET

endstream
endobj
