(>> Solution to Question 4:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the Iteration Protocol, While Loops, and Sentinel-Controlled Loops in Python. Detail condition evaluation, loop termination, and infinite loop prevention.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Iteration Protocol and While Loop Mechanics:) Tj
T*
(   The while loop is a pre-test loop construct that repeatedly executes its body suite as long as) Tj
T*
(   a controlling test expression evaluates to a truthy boolean value.) Tj
T*
(   Execution Cycle:) Tj
T*
(   1. Evaluate test condition.) Tj
T*
(   2. If condition is False or falsy, terminate loop and resume execution after while block.) Tj
T*
(   3. If condition is True or truthy, execute statements in the loop suite.) Tj
T*
(   4. Jump back to Step 1.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Sentinel-Controlled Loops:) Tj
T*
(   In interactive or streaming systems, the exact number of iterations is unknown prior to) Tj
T*
(   execution. A 'sentinel value' is a designated terminal token \(e.g., -1, 'QUIT', None\) that) Tj
T*
(   signals the loop to cease iteration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Infinite Loops & Prevention Strategies:) Tj
T*
(   An infinite loop occurs when the loop condition never evaluates to False.) Tj
T*
(   Prevention Strategies:) Tj
T*
(   1. Ensure loop body modifies the variable participating in the test condition \(progress towards) Tj
T*
(   termination\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Incorporate explicit safety iteration caps \(max_retries counter\).) Tj
T*
(   3. Use break conditions based on timeout or sentinel detection.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Python Demonstration Code:) Tj
T*
(   def simulate_sensor_monitoring\(readings, sentinel=-999\):) Tj
T*
(   """Process streaming data until sentinel value is detected.""") Tj
T*
(   idx = 0) Tj
T*
(   valid_readings = []) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Sentinel-controlled loop) Tj
T*
(   while idx < len\(readings\):) Tj
T*
(   current_val = readings[idx]) Tj
T*
(   idx += 1) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   if current_val == sentinel:) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Sentinel token \({sentinel}\) encountered. Halting sensor ingest."\)) Tj
T*
(   break) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   valid_readings.append\(current_val\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
endobj
