BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the range\(\) type in Python 3. Detail its lazy evaluation, arithmetic progression parameters, and internal memory efficiency compared to Python 2 range.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Architecture of range in Python 3:) Tj
T*
(   In Python 3, range is not a function that generates a list; it is an immutable sequence type) Tj
T*
(   representing an arithmetic progression of integers:) Tj
T*
(   Syntax: range\(start, stop[, step]\)) Tj
T*
(   - start: First integer in progression \(default: 0\).) Tj
T*
(   - stop: Exclusive upper/lower bound.) Tj
T*
(   - step: Increment between consecutive integers \(default: 1; cannot be 0\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Lazy Evaluation & Memory Invariance:) Tj
T*
(   A Python 3 range object does NOT store its constituent integers in memory! Regardless of) Tj
T*
(   whether a range represents 10 elements or 10 billion elements, its memory footprint is) Tj
T*
(   identical and constant: O\(1\).) Tj
T*
(   It stores only three attributes:) Tj
T*
(   1. start) Tj
T*
(   2. stop) Tj
T*
(   3. step) Tj
T*
(   Integers are calculated on-the-fly dynamically only when requested during iteration or) Tj
T*
(   indexing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Advanced Capabilities of Python 3 range:) Tj
T*
(   - Direct Indexing: range\(10, 100, 5\)[3] computes 10 + 3*5 = 25 in O\(1\) time without generating) Tj
T*
(   elements.) Tj
T*
(   - Membership Testing: \(55 in range\(10, 100, 5\)\) executes in O\(1\) time via modular arithmetic:) Tj
T*
(   Checks: 10 <= 55 < 100 and \(55 - 10\) % 5 == 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Slicing: Slicing a range produces another range object in O\(1\) time.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Python Demonstration Code:) Tj
T*
(   import sys) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   r_small = range\(10\)) Tj
T*
(   r_huge = range\(10_000_000_000\) # 10 Billion integers) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Memory size of range\(10\): {sys.getsizeof\(r_small\)} bytes"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Memory size of range\(10 Billion\): {sys.getsizeof\(r_huge\)} bytes \(Exact same O\(1\)) Tj
T*
(   memory!\)"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # O\(1\) Direct Indexing) Tj
T*
(   val_at_idx = r_huge[500]) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"r_huge[500] = {val_at_idx} \(Retrieved instantaneously!\)"\)) Tj
T*
ET

