BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Break and Continue Statements. Detail how they alter control flow within while and for loops, and explain their interaction with the loop else clause.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Control Flow Alterations via Break and Continue:) Tj
T*
(   - break Statement: Immediately terminates execution of the innermost enclosing loop. Control) Tj
T*
(   passes directly to the statement immediately following the loop block.) Tj
T*
(   - continue Statement: Immediately skips the remaining statements in the current iteration) Tj
T*
(   suite. Control jumps directly to the condition re-evaluation \(in while loops\) or the next item) Tj
T*
(   fetch \(in for loops\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Loop 'else' Clause:) Tj
T*
(   Python features a unique and powerful construct: loops can have an optional else clause!) Tj
T*
(   Semantic Rule: The else suite of a loop executes if and only if the loop completes all) Tj
T*
(   iterations normally without encountering a break statement.) Tj
T*
(   If a loop terminates prematurely due to a break, the else clause is completely skipped.) Tj
T*
(   Common Use Cases:) Tj
T*
(   - Search algorithms: If target is found -> break; else -> target not found in collection.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Code Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   def prime_check\(n: int\) -> bool:) Tj
T*
(   """Determine primality using for-else search pattern.""") Tj
T*
(   if n < 2:) Tj
T*
(   return False) Tj
T*
(   # Check factors from 2 up to sqrt\(n\)) Tj
T*
(   for divisor in range\(2, int\(n ** 0.5\) + 1\):) Tj
T*
(   if n % divisor == 0:) Tj
T*
(   print\(f" {n} is composite: divisible by {divisor}"\)) Tj
T*
(   break # Break bypasses the else block!) Tj
T*
(   else:) Tj
T*
(   # Executes ONLY if loop finished without breaking) Tj
T*
(   print\(f" {n} is a PRIME number!"\)) Tj
T*
(   return True) Tj
T*
(   return False) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   print\("Testing Prime Check with Loop-Else:"\)) Tj
T*
(   prime_check\(29\)) Tj
T*
(   prime_check\(35\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Continue Statement Demonstration) Tj
T*
(   print\("\\nOdd Numbers Filter using continue:"\)) Tj
T*
(   for num in range\(1, 8\):) Tj
T*
(   if num % 2 == 0:) Tj
T*
(   continue # Skip even numbers) Tj
T*
(   print\(f" Processing Odd: {num}"\)) Tj
T*
ET

