/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Implement the Bubble Sort algorithm in Python using nested loops. Implement an early-exit optimization flag and analyze worst, average, and best-case complexities.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Theoretical Mechanics of Bubble Sort:) Tj
T*
(   Bubble Sort repeatedly steps through a list, compares adjacent elements, and swaps them if they) Tj
T*
(   are in the wrong order. With each outer pass, the largest unsorted element 'bubbles up' to its) Tj
T*
(   final position at the end of the array.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Early-Exit Optimization Flag:) Tj
T*
(   In standard Bubble Sort, the algorithm always runs N*\(N - 1\)/2 comparisons even if the list is) Tj
T*
(   already completely sorted.) Tj
T*
(   By introducing a boolean flag \(swapped = False\), if an entire pass completes without a single) Tj
T*
(   swap, the list is already sorted, and the algorithm terminates immediately in O\(N\) time!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Implementation:) Tj
T*
(   def bubble_sort_optimized\(arr: list\) -> tuple:) Tj
T*
(   """Optimized Bubble Sort with early-exit flag.""") Tj
T*
(   a = arr.copy\(\)) Tj
T*
(   n = len\(a\)) Tj
T*
(   total_comparisons = 0) Tj
T*
(   total_swaps = 0) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   for i in range\(n\):) Tj
T*
(   swapped = False) Tj
T*
(   # Inner loop: Last i elements are already sorted in place) Tj
T*
(   for j in range\(0, n - i - 1\):) Tj
T*
(   total_comparisons += 1) Tj
T*
(   if a[j] > a[j + 1]:) Tj
T*
(   # Swap adjacent elements) Tj
T*
(   a[j], a[j + 1] = a[j + 1], a[j]) Tj
T*
(   total_swaps += 1) Tj
T*
(   swapped = True) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # If no elements were swapped in this pass, array is sorted!) Tj
T*
(   if not swapped:) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Early exit triggered at pass {i + 1}: Array is fully sorted."\)) Tj
T*
(   break) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   return a, total_comparisons, total_swaps) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Verification) Tj
T*
(   unsorted_list = [64, 34, 25, 12, 22, 11, 90]) Tj
T*
(   sorted_list, comps, swaps = bubble_sort_optimized\(unsorted_list\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Unsorted: {unsorted_list}"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Sorted: {sorted_list} | Comparisons: {comps} | Swaps: {swaps}"\)) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
