12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the itertools module in Python. Demonstrate infinite iterators \(count, cycle, repeat\) and combinatoric generators \(product, permutations, combinations\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Architecture of the itertools Module:) Tj
T*
(   The itertools module provides highly optimized, memory-efficient C-level iterators for fast) Tj
T*
(   looping:) Tj
T*
(   - Infinite Iterators: count\(\), cycle\(\), repeat\(\).) Tj
T*
(   - Terminating Combinatoric Iterators: product\(\), permutations\(\), combinations\(\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Core Iterators:) Tj
T*
(   - itertools.count\(start, step\): Generates infinite sequence start, start+step, start+2*step...) Tj
T*
(   - itertools.cycle\(iterable\): Cycles through an iterable indefinitely.) Tj
T*
(   - itertools.product\(*iterables, repeat=1\): Cartesian product \(equivalent to nested for loops\).) Tj
T*
(   - itertools.permutations\(iterable, r\): Successive r-length permutations with order mattering.) Tj
T*
(   - itertools.combinations\(iterable, r\): Successive r-length combinations without replacement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   import itertools) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 1. Cartesian Product) Tj
T*
(   colors = ["Red", "Blue"]) Tj
T*
(   sizes = ["S", "M", "L"]) Tj
T*
(   cartesian = list\(itertools.product\(colors, sizes\)\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Cartesian Product \(Colors x Sizes\): {cartesian}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 2. Permutations & Combinations) Tj
T*
(   letters = ['A', 'B', 'C']) Tj
T*
(   perms = list\(itertools.permutations\(letters, 2\)\)) Tj
T*
(   combs = list\(itertools.combinations\(letters, 2\)\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Permutations of 3 choose 2 \(P\(3,2\)=6\): {perms}"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Combinations of 3 choose 2 \(C\(3,2\)=3\): {combs}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 3. Controlled Infinite Iterator \(count + islice\)) Tj
T*
(   counter = itertools.count\(start=100, step=10\)) Tj
T*
(   first_5 = list\(itertools.islice\(counter, 5\)\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"itertools.count first 5 elements: {first_5}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - Cartesian Product Time: O\(N * M\).) Tj
T*
(   - Combinations Time: O\(N! / \(r! * \(N - r\)!\)\).) Tj
T*
(   - Space Complexity: O\(r\) auxiliary generator frame \(streaming\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
