(   [Problem Statement]: Design a Python program to solve the 0/1 Knapsack Problem or Subset Sum Problem using iterative dynamic programming tables and nested loops.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Theoretical Formulation of 0/1 Knapsack:) Tj
T*
(   Given N items, each with weight w[i] and value v[i], and a knapsack with maximum weight) Tj
T*
(   capacity W:) Tj
T*
(   Determine the maximum value achievable without exceeding weight W.) Tj
T*
(   Recurrence Relation:) Tj
T*
(   For item i \(1 <= i <= N\) and weight w \(0 <= w <= W\):) Tj
T*
