/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Implement a Monte Carlo Simulation in Python to estimate the mathematical constant Pi \(pi\) using random numbers and circular geometry.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Theoretical Basis of Monte Carlo Pi Estimation:) Tj
T*
(   Consider a 2D square with side length 2R centered at origin \(area = \(2R\)^2 = 4*R^2\).) Tj
T*
(   Inside this square, inscribe a circle of radius R \(area = pi * R^2\).) Tj
T*
ET

